{"title":"Ashsworn Flamekeeper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 60 Ashsworn that attacks with burn (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (10.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=60\">Lv 60 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>45</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>15</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=60\" title=\"Pick level 60\"><td><b>60</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>455</td><td>37.5</td><td>3,000</td><td class=\"muted\">1,365 · 52.5 · 9,000</td><td>36</td><td>in the wilds around 232, -1117</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>45</td><td>in the wilds around 273, -1175</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper?lv=62\" title=\"Pick level 62\"><td><b>62</b></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>15</td><td>in the wilds around 275, -1189</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ashsworn-flamekeeper\" data-map-level=\"61\">Show level 61 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 6 recorded drops, 1,142 total, 50–504 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×50–504</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-kryss\" title=\"Titanium Kryss - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/59f833ee7c52ee8c1c91.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Kryss</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\" title=\"Titanium Dagger - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ash-charm\" title=\"Ash Charm - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f82a451885528bc6a9e6.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ash Charm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 1 of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/3<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 7</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6304\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1975.1px,613.3px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/6/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1536px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:1846.6px;top:-606.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1863.1px;top:-609.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1967.6px;top:-569.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1981.3px;top:-632.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1959.4px;top:-616.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2080.5px;top:-606.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:1986.7px;top:-636.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1989.6px;top:-616.0px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 272, -1165 <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 232, -1117 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ashsworn-flamekeeper\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ashcaller-vigdis\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5959181828b3928f61a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Ashcaller Vigdis</b><span>Lv 61</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ashsworn: <a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-acolyte\">Ashsworn Acolyte</a> <span class=\"muted\">(57)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-pyromancer\">Ashsworn Pyromancer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/keeper-hallgrim\">Keeper Hallgrim</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ash-prophet\">Ash Prophet</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b7621d32a67a5218c603.svg\" alt=\"Ashsworn Flamekeeper\"></div><h3>Ashsworn Flamekeeper</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 60)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ashsworn</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>burn · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>4.5</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>10 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}